<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 1.96 points off UK's FTSE index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 1.96 points off UK's FTSE index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>FTSE International said the following FTSE 100 index stocks will go ex-dividend on Monday and the effect will be to take 1.963 points off the index today.</p>
<p>					   DIVIDEND    INDEX</p>
<p>					   (PENCE)     EFFECT</p>
<p>COMPANY				 Net   Gross  Gross</p>
<p>* Argos				 5.30   6.63   0.111</p>
<p>* Burmah Castrol		   12.00  15.00   0.185</p>
<p>* Guinness			    4.55   5.69   0.643</p>
<p>* Royal &amp; Sun Alliance	    6.50   8.13   0.737</p>
<p>* United News &amp; Media	     8.00  10.00   0.287</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
</text>
